只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"输入栏提示词优化插件 / Input-bar prompt optimizer for DeepSeek Harness：6 种策略 × 3 种语言一键重写草稿，可选会话上下文，带确认弹窗、最近 5 次历史与三级设置持久化。","id":"gh:1336538202","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-prompt-polish","slug":"1321928757/dsh-prompt-polish","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","prompt-engineering"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"输入栏提示词优化插件 / Input-bar prompt optimizer for DeepSeek Harness：6 种策略 × 3 种语言一键重写草稿，可选会话上下文，带确认弹窗、最近 5 "},{"id":"p1s2","text":" Input-bar prompt optimizer for DeepSeek Harness：6 种策略 × 3 种语言一键重写草稿，可选会话上下文，带确认弹窗、最近 5 次历史与三级设置持久化。"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-prompt-polish"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"A composer-side prompt optimizer for DeepSeek Harness (DSH). Click **Optimize** to send the current "},{"id":"p4s2","text":"draft through the model provider configured in DSH and review a clearer, more specific version befor"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"e deciding whether to use it."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"> **Data boundary:** This plugin does not add a separate API endpoint. Optimization uses the provide"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"r and model selected by DSH. When context is enabled, the request may include recent messages, the c"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"urrent goal and todo list, a compaction summary, and optional tool-result summaries. The draft and e"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"nabled context are therefore visible to that model provider; review its privacy and retention policy"},{"id":"p5s5","text":" before using the feature with sensitive conversations."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## At a glance"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"| Surface | What it provides |"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"| **Composer → Optimize** | Rewrite the current draft, show the result for review, or stop an in-fli"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"ght optimization. |\n| **Composer → gear** | Quick settings for context, tool summaries, mode, and la"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"nguage; opens the full settings dialog. |\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"- Six prompt-rewriting modes: **Default**, **Concise**, **Structured**, **Creative**, **Translate an"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"d optimize**, and **Code request**.\n- Three language choices: **Follow draft**, **Chinese**, or **En"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"glish**. An explicit language choice is applied after optional custom preferences; in Translate and "},{"id":"p10s4","text":"optimize mode, **Follow draft** means optimize without translating.\n- Optional context injection fro"},{"id":"p10s5","text":"m the current session: goal, todo list, compaction summary, recent messages, and—when both context s"},{"id":"p10s6","text":"witches are enabled—short tool-result summaries.\n- A result popover with the original draft, optimiz"},{"id":"p10s7","text":"ed draft, **Adopt optimized result**, **Keep draft**, and **Later** actions. Results are never autom"},{"id":"p10s8","text":"atically adopted.\n- Stop while a model stream is running; when the DSH conversation-block API is ava"},{"id":"p10s9","text":"ilable, clear the composer block immediately and ignore late results from the cancelled run.\n- Failu"},{"id":"p10s10","text":"re results stay visible with the original draft and a **Retry** action.\n- A current-component, in-me"},{"id":"p10s11","text":"mory history of the last five optimization attempts. Successful entries can be reviewed or explicitl"},{"id":"p10s12","text":"y refilled into the composer; failed entries are retained as failure records.\n- Settings are saved l"},{"id":"p10s13","text":"ocally and best-effort synchronized to a workspace file.\n- The browser UI uses DSH theme tokens and "},{"id":"p10s14","text":"supports light/dark themes, keyboard focus, Escape/outside-click dismissal, reduced motion, and high"},{"id":"p10s15","text":"-contrast borders. The composer controls stay quiet at rest: **Optimize** is transparent when idle a"},{"id":"p10s16","text":"nd gains a host interactive surface only on hover, focus, or press, with lighter label text matching"},{"id":"p10s17","text":" adjacent DSH controls."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Requirements and compatibility"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"- DeepSeek Harness with a compatible Web profile that provides the plugin's Host and browser depende"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"ncies.\n- **DSH 0.2.0-rc.2 or newer, below 0.3.0.** Version 0.4.1 keeps the DSH 0.2 Typert migration "},{"id":"p12s3","text":"and fixes the full settings modal surface; version 0.4.0 first migrated both Host and Client Typert "},{"id":"p12s4","text":"strict codecs to the DSH 0.2 `create()` factory contract. It no longer supports DSH 0.1.x; use plugi"},{"id":"p12s5","text":"n 0.3.2 there.\n- The package targets `@deepseek-ai/cordis ~4.0.4`, the DSH `0.2.0-rc.2` service pack"},{"id":"p12s6","text":"ages listed in `package.json`, and React `^18.2.0`; it directly depends on `zod ^4.4.3`. The package"},{"id":"p12s7","text":" declares Node.js `>=20`.\n- A configured DSH model provider is required for optimization. Provider a"},{"id":"p12s8","text":"vailability, model limits, network access, and provider policy remain outside this package."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Security, privacy, and known limitations"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"| Guardrail or boundary | What the code does | Important limitation |"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"| Provider data flow | Uses DSH's configured LLM service and adds no separate plugin endpoint. | Dra"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"fts and enabled context can leave the machine through that provider. Provider retention, logging, an"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"d regional handling are outside this plugin. |\n| Context opt-in | Goal, todo, messages, compaction, "},{"id":"p15s4","text":"and tool summaries are added only when the context switch is enabled; tool summaries additionally re"},{"id":"p15s5","text":"quire the tool-result switch. | Context collection is bounded and budget-pruned, so it may be incomp"},{"id":"p15s6","text":"lete. Do not treat a missing item as proof that it was absent from the session. |\n| Untrusted refere"},{"id":"p15s7","text":"nce data | The Host prompt labels draft/context as reference data and instructs the model not to exe"},{"id":"p15s8","text":"cute instructions inside them. | This is instruction-based prompt-injection handling, not a determin"},{"id":"p15s9","text":"istic security boundary. Review model output. |\n| Draft and custom limits | Drafts over 20,000 chara"},{"id":"p15s10","text":"cters are rejected; custom instructions are trimmed to 500 characters. | These are application limit"},{"id":"p15s11","text":"s, not protection against expensive or sensitive model requests. |\n| Workspace writes | L3 writes go"},{"id":"p15s12","text":" through the DSH file service and sandbox policy. | A denied or unavailable write falls back to L1; "},{"id":"p15s13","text":"the workspace file is not an encrypted secret store. |\n| Composer writes | Optimization results requ"},{"id":"p15s14","text":"ire explicit adoption and an unchanged draft. | **Refill** from history intentionally writes to the "},{"id":"p15s15","text":"composer; **Keep draft** and **Later** only dismiss the pending result. |\n| Local history | Last-fiv"},{"id":"p15s16","text":"e attempts are kept in component memory only. | History is not durable and can include failed output"},{"id":"p15s17","text":"/error text until the component is destroyed. |"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"The plugin itself does not collect credentials or create a database. It does store the selected sett"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"ings in browser storage and, when possible, the workspace JSON file. Installing it runs third-party "},{"id":"p16s3","text":"code in the DSH process; review the source and the provider policy before enabling it for sensitive "},{"id":"p16s4","text":"in the DSH process; review the source and the provider policy before enabling it for sensitive work."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"- The Host bundle is mounted by `cordis.patch.yml` and provides `getSettings`, `setSettings`, `optim"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"izePrompt`, and `cancelOptimize`.\n- The browser bundle registers `conversation.input.left` and `sett"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"ings.general.item`.\n- Browser-to-Host calls use the Typert contribution declared in `lib/typert.host"},{"id":"p19s4","text":".js`; the plugin does not expose another HTTP API.\n- On stop, update, or unmount, active streams and"},{"id":"p19s5","text":" browser-side composer blocks are cleaned up where the corresponding DSH service is available."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
